    <model name='inmoov_right_hand'>
    <!-- Visually re-verified in the GUI: with roll=pi the forearm/hand assembly extends
         UPWARD from base_link's origin (fingers up), not down as the old single-hand
         model's comment assumed - base_link's origin is effectively the cut/elbow end.
         Mount z is set to the workbench top surface (0.45) so that elbow end sits on
         the table and the hand stands up from it, instead of floating at the old z=1. -->
